<title>PORTUGAL: Lisbon trade to resume in Totta, Sotto Mayor.</title>
<headline>Lisbon trade to resume in Totta, Sotto Mayor.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1997-01-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dealers said that share trade in Banco Totta &amp; Acores and Banco Sotto &amp; Pinto Mayor would resume at 1535 GMT.  </p>
<p>Trade in the two banks, both part of the Champalimaud group, was suspended early on Friday after newspapers reported that a merger was being prepared.</p>
<p>The suspension was lifted after the Champalimaud group issued statements saying that there were no such plans.</p>
<p>--Lisbon bureau 3511-3150035</p>
</text>
